### AccountOS API Test Endpoints
### Development: http://localhost:5043 veya https://localhost:7043

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043/api/v1

### ===============================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ===============================

### 1. Register (Kayıt ol)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "phone": "+90 555 123 4567"
}

### 2. Login (Giriş yap)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

### 3. Extract Access Token
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ===============================
### SAMPLE ENDPOINTS (Protected)
### ===============================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/sample/health

### Create Sample (Validation Error - name boş)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sample
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "test"
}

### Create Sample (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sample
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "Test Description"
}

### Get Sample (test için bir guid koy)
@sampleId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
GET {{baseUrl}}/sample/{{sampleId}}

### ===============================
### PROTECTED ENDPOINTS (JWT Required)
### ===============================

### Test Protected Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/sample/health
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
